[en.FOCUS_C11_CONQUER_REINDEER]
Conquer the Reindeers

[en.FOCUS_C11_CONQUER_REINDEER_desc]
Among the northern snowy mountains of the Changeling Empire, there lives a group of reindeers, who seem to have no interest in the outside world, nor do they have any intention of contributing love to the Changeling Empire. For such a self-contained tribe, conquest should be an easy thing, but is it really?\nNot to mention how less love can the small reindeer territory contribute, which may not even offset the cost of the war, these are all debatable problems. More importantly, a wise reindeer who is able to foresee the future once warned our ambassador, that our destiny is written in the stars. What does this mean? It seems that going to war with the reindeers may bring unexpected results.

[zh.FOCUS_C11_CONQUER_REINDEER]
对驯鹿的征服

[zh.FOCUS_C11_CONQUER_REINDEER_desc]
在幻形灵帝国北方的雪山中居住着一群驯鹿，他们对外界似乎没有什么兴趣，也自然没有向幻形灵帝国进贡爱意的意愿。对于这种自我封闭的小部落，征服应该是一种轻而易举的事情，然而，真的是这样吗？\n且不说小小的驯鹿领地可以贡献多少爱意，能否抵得上大动干戈的成本，这些都是可以商榷的。更重要的是，驯鹿中一位可以预见未来的智者曾经警告过我们派去的使者，她说：我们的命运都记载于星辰之上。这句话的意思是什么呢？似乎对驯鹿开战可能会招致意想不到的结果。

